%% Clinic Setup and Staff Booking
%% Summary: Shows doctor settings and staff management, the shared clinic booking path, agenda, and local email preview.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Doctor as Doctor / Admin
    actor Staff
    participant App as Booking App
    participant Auth as Auth and Access
    participant Schedule as Shared Scheduling Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Email as Email Preview / Provider

    Note over Doctor,Email: Clinic Setup and Staff Booking<br/>Shows doctor settings and staff management, the shared clinic booking path, agenda, and local email preview.

    rect rgb(238, 246, 255)
        Note over Doctor,DB: Clinic setup and staff management
        Doctor->>App: Configure hours, breaks and special dates
        App->>Schedule: Save availability change
        Schedule->>DB: Validate conflicts and persist schedule
        Doctor->>App: Add, list, disable or re-enable staff
        App->>Auth: Apply admin-only staff management
        Auth->>DB: Save staff access and revoke sessions on disable
        Doctor->>App: Open daily agenda
        App->>DB: Read appointments for selected clinic date
        DB-->>App: Confirmed, cancelled and other history
        App-->>Doctor: Show agenda and appointment details
    end

    rect rgb(241, 250, 242)
        Note over Staff,Email: Staff booking
        Staff->>App: Open agenda or book appointment
        App->>DB: Read agenda or request available slots
        Staff->>App: Enter patient details and confirm
        App->>Schedule: Confirm clinic-created booking
        Schedule->>DB: Lock doctor, recheck and commit appointment, occupancy, audit and receipt
        Note over Schedule,DB: Local email template job is included in this transaction when localhost preview fallback applies.
        DB-->>Schedule: Commit succeeded
        Schedule-->>App: Confirmed clinic-created appointment
        opt SMTP_HOST absent or blank on localhost development/test
            App->>Email: After commit, write redacted simulated confirmation log
            Email-->>App: Preview result, booking remains confirmed if logging fails
        end
        Note over Staff,Email: Clinic-created visits do not auto-link patient accounts or request WhatsApp delivery.
    end
